  "verseCount": 25,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "12",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JOB 12"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "12",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Job",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 12:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then Job replied:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.12.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Doubtless you are the only people who matter,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.12.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 12:2"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and wisdom will die with you!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.12.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But I have a mind as well as you;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.12.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 12:3"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "I am not inferior to you.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.12.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 12:3"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Who does not know all these things?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.12.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"I have become a laughingstock to my friends,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.12.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 12:4"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "though I called on God and he answered—",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.12.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 12:4"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "a mere laughingstock, though righteous and blameless!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.12.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Those who are at ease have contempt for misfortune",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.12.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 12:5"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "as the fate of those whose feet are slipping.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.12.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The tents of marauders are undisturbed,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.12.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 12:6"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and those who provoke God are secure—",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.12.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 12:6"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "those God has in his hand.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.12.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"But ask the animals, and they will teach you,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.12.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 12:7"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "or the birds in the sky, and they will tell you;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.12.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "or speak to the earth, and it will teach you,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.12.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 12:8"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "or let the fish in the sea inform you.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.12.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 12:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Which of all these does not know",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.12.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 12:9"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "that the hand of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.12.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.12.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.12.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "has done this?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.12.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 12:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "In his hand is the life of every creature",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.12.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 12:10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and the breath of all mankind.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.12.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Does not the ear test words",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.12.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 12:11"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "as the tongue tastes food?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.12.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Is not wisdom found among the aged?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.12.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 12:12"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Does not long life bring understanding?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.12.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 12:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"To God belong wisdom and power;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.12.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 12:13"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "counsel and understanding are his.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.12.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "What he tears down cannot be rebuilt;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.12.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 12:14"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "those he imprisons cannot be released.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.12.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 12:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If he holds back the waters, there is drought;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.12.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 12:15"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "if he lets them loose, they devastate the land.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.12.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 12:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To him belong strength and insight;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.12.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.12.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 12:16"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "both deceived and deceiver are his.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.12.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.12.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 12:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He leads rulers away stripped",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.12.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.12.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 12:17"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and makes fools of judges.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.12.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.12.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 12:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He takes off the shackles put on by kings",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.12.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.12.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 12:18"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and ties a loincloth",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.12.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.12.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "around their waist.",
